Built-in catalog data
---------------------
The files in crates/ballistics-store/catalog/ (calibers, bullets, scopes,
reticles and targets) are NOT covered by the licences above.

  * Bullet, ammunition and scope figures are factual specifications compiled
    from the manufacturers' published product information (and, for a few
    entries, retailers' pages). Each entry names its source.
  * Reticle drawings reproduce the manufacturers' published subtension
    diagrams so the app can show holds through the scope. Some are traced
    from the manufacturers' own vector drawings. Before distributing the app
    publicly or commercially, get the manufacturers' permission or replace
    these drawings.
  * ISSF target dimensions follow the ISSF rules; the game guideline values
    (vital zones, minimum energies) are the project's own.

Product and company names (for example Kahles, Vortex, Norma, Lapua,
Hornady, Federal, Strelok Pro) and reticle names (for example EBR-7C,
Dead-Hold, SKMR4) are trademarks of their owners. They are used only to
identify the products. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
any of them.

The Strelok Pro importer reads backup files for interoperability. It
contains no Strelok code or data.

No warranty
-----------
Ballistic predictions are estimates. Always confirm your rifle's point of
impact on paper at real distances before hunting, and follow your country's
hunting laws.
